      "risk": "medium",
      "risk_reason": "Only for the habitual residence partly used for the activity. IRPF uses 30% of the floor-area share unless another percentage is proven; claiming a proven different percentage needs the manual path. IVA is entered manually from actual business use and supporting evidence, and requires a complete invoice. Copying the proposal preserves the entered IVA.",
